      "post": {
        "description": "Records a passing time at a station. Roles: Admin, or the station's own group (Zeitnahme_Start for start, Zeitnahme_3000m for 3000m, Zeitnahme_6000m for 6000m). Idempotent per entry_id: a repeat returns 200 with status duplicate. Corrections are new entries, the latest recorded_at wins. With deleted=true the entry is a delete marker (soft delete): the boat is left out of the exports while the marker is its latest entry, the history is kept, and passed_at is optional. With invalidates set to an entry_id the entry is an invalidation marker: it cancels the entry of the same boat with that entry_id, so a wrong entry (for example a mistyped boat number) no longer counts. The marker itself and the cancelled entry are ignored when selecting the current value, the history is kept, and passed_at is optional and ignored. It cannot be combined with deleted, and a marker cannot be cancelled.",
